A so-called tubing set for arthroscopy pumps with—according to specifications—the following composition and characteristics, among others:
- for use in arthroscopic surgery (keyhole surgery) for regulating fluids in a joint space, such as knees, shoulders, and ankles;
- for single use or, where applicable, for controlled use within a single operating day;
- manufactured from plastic, such as specifically designed components of PVC, ABS, PP, and HDPE;
- free of latex and DEHP (di(2-ethylhexyl)phthalate);
- equipped with plastic components including, among others, a connector, rotary Luer-lock connection, Luer cap, clamp, non-return valve, so-called spikes, drip chamber assembly, color-coded tubing lines, a pump segment, connection cassette, and connection for a sensor;
- a pressure resistance of less than 27.6 MPa;
- sterile packaged, for use in a sterile environment;
- a length of at least 2.4 to a maximum of 6.1 meters.

A so-called tubing set for arthroscopy pumps with—according to specifications—among other things the following composition and characteristics:
- for use in arthroscopic surgery (keyhole surgery) for regulating fluids in a joint space, such as knees, shoulders, and ankles;
- for single use or, where applicable, for controlled use within a single operating day;
- manufactured of plastic, such as specifically designed components of ABS, PP, and HDPE;
- free of latex and DEHP (di(2-ethylhexyl)phthalate);
- equipped with plastic components such as a connector, rotating Luer-lock connection, Luer cap, clamp, and non-return valve;
- a pressure resistance of less than 27.6 MPa;
- sterile packaged, for use in a sterile environment;
- a length of 3 meters.

A clear liquid with—as specified—among others the following characteristics and composition:
- for use in the food industry;
- for increasing the food safety and shelf life of foodstuffs;
- prevents the growth of bacteria, molds, and yeasts in meat, poultry, and fish and shellfish;
- natural, organic buffered vinegar, in liquid form, manufactured by a fermentation process using specific food cultures.

A clear liquid with—according to specifications—among others the following characteristics and composition:
- for use in the food industry;
- for increasing the food safety and shelf life of foodstuffs;
- prevents the growth of pathogens in chilled meat, poultry, and ready-to-eat products;
- buffered vinegar in liquid form, manufactured by a natural fermentation process using food cultures.

A clear liquid with -according to specifications- the following characteristics and composition, among others:
- for use in the food industry;
- for increasing food safety and shelf life;
- prevents the growth of bacteria, molds, and yeasts in meat, poultry, and fish and shellfish;
- vinegar based on a buffered potassium hydroxide acetic acid concentrate in liquid form, manufactured by fermentation.

A light yellow liquid with—according to specifications—among others the following characteristics and composition:
- for use in the food industry;
- for increasing the food safety and shelf life of foodstuffs;
- for products with a balanced taste;
- prevents the growth of pathogens in fresh meat, poultry, and ready-to-eat products;
- buffered vinegar in liquid form, manufactured by a natural fermentation process using food cultures.

A dark brown liquid with—according to specifications—among others the following characteristics and composition:
- for use in the food industry;
- for increasing the food safety and shelf life of foodstuffs;
- developed to inhibit the growth of spoilage-causing bacteria and pathogens in chilled meat and seafood;
- buffered vinegar in liquid form, manufactured by a natural fermentation process using food cultures.
